# device_root_page_teardown: A root page change with everything live on the old root: child FIFOs 1 and 2 (the FIFO teardown deletes each, zeroing the next node's page list word), a task (its word stays), and a display shared state page on port 0 (its word is cleared while running). The new root starts empty.
